==Trivia==
*Like [[Mr. Ninja (Special Cat)|Mr. Ninja]], Slug Jockey Cat is a character from [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]]' simulation game, '''''Namesta''''' (なめすた), introduced in the 5th [[BitSummit Collaboration Event|BitSummit Indie Game Festival]].
*This Cat was available to players of the second round of The Great Cat Tournament in their provided save.
*Slug Jockey Cat was originally a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]].
*When the [[Sliming to Victory]] event was first made available, none of the stages had Slug Jockey Cat as a reward, making this Cat unobtainable for over a year.

